WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Board view. A Kanban board: drag cards between columns to change their status.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: stand-up; finishing.

3
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:11.330
The board shows tasks as cards in their columns.

4
00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:13.650
Drag a card by its grip to another column — its status follows.

5
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:17.100
It's saved: the task is now done.

6
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:23.100
Dragging opens the task: Drag by the ⋮⋮ grip, not the title.

7
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:27.600
Drag by the grip
